OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for sexual abuse and
OL,4,Aattempted rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for more than 20
OL,7,Fyears for sexually abusing two girls
OL,8,Fand trying to rape a woman.
OL,10,FJawhir Kasir, 47, from Coventry,
OL,11,Fsexually assaulted the children between
OL,12,F2006 and 2008, with the attempted rape
OL,13,Ffollowing in 2010, West Midlands Police
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FHe was arrested at Birmingham Airport
OL,17,Fon 26 November after all three of his
OL,18,Fvictims came forward to report Kasir's
OL,19,Fcrimes last year, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
