OL,4,Aattempted rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FKasir, of no fixed address, was
OL,7,Fconvicted of seven sex offences in
OL,8,Ftotal following a trial and was
OL,9,Fsentenced to 22 years in prison at
OL,10,FWarwick Crown Court on 22 September.
